& [Acceptance]
  + all intermediate phases validate independently and preserve exact predecessor values
  + illegal skips repeats regressions wrong transition counters malformed flags digest changes response presence changes and unknown fields fail closed
  + locally coherent envelope substitution can reach response-recorded but cannot reach canonical admission
  + wrong canonical transport wrong response reordered traces and terminal-versus-iteration admission fail closed
