& [IdentityBoundary]
  + FixtureDispatchRecorded means an effectless test transition was recorded and never means bytes left the process
  + FixtureResponseRecorded means supplied bytes are retained and digested and never means a provider produced them
  + Admitted means envelope and response equal canonical fixture custody and never means model semantics truth or authentication
  + a future live adapter must supply separate physical dispatch response provenance and process evidence under new authority

